{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Starlink (tle_position) on a Geomap using InfluxDB 1.x InfluxQL only. Configure the Influx datasource with database n2yo (or your -db). Shows up to 100 satellites (SLIMIT 100) — series order is server-defined. Use time range of a few minutes for fresh points.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "influxdb", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 22, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "basemap": { "name": "Basemap", "type": "default" },
        "controls": {
          "mouseWheelZoom": true,
          "showAttribution": true,
          "showDebug": false,
          "showScale": true,
          "showZoom": true
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "name": "Starlink (100)",
            "type": "markers",
            "tooltip": true,
            "config": {
              "showLegend": true,
              "style": {
                "color": { "field": "alt_km", "fixed": "dark-blue" },
                "opacity": 0.85,
                "rotation": { "fixed": 0, "max": 360, "min": -360, "mode": "mod" },
                "size": { "field": "alt_km", "fixed": 6, "max": 14, "min": 3 },
                "symbol": { "fixed": "img/icons/marker/circle.svg", "mode": "fixed" },
                "text": { "field": "satname", "fixed": "", "mode": "field" },
                "textConfig": { "fontSize": 10, "offsetX": 0, "offsetY": -8, "textAlign": "center", "textBaseline": "bottom" }
              }
            },
            "location": { "mode": "coords", "latitude": "latitude", "longitude": "longitude" }
          }
        ],
        "tooltip": { "mode": "details" },
        "view": { "id": "zero", "lat": 20, "lon": 0, "zoom": 1.3 }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "repeat": null,
      "repeatDirection": "h",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "influxdb", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "rawQuery": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "resultFormat": "table",
          "query": "SELECT\n  last(\"satlatitude\")  AS \"latitude\",\n  last(\"satlongitude\")  AS \"longitude\",\n  last(\"sataltitude_km\") AS \"alt_km\"\nFROM \"tle_position\"\nWHERE $timeFilter\nGROUP BY \"satid\", \"satname\"\nSLIMIT 100"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Up to 100 Starlink sats (latest position, InfluxQL table)",
      "type": "geomap"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "Requires **InfluxDB 1.x** datasource, **no Flux**. Set datasource **Database** to the DB n2yo-influx writes to (default `n2yo`).\n\nQuery uses `GROUP BY \"satid\",\"satname\"` and **`SLIMIT 100`**. To color/size by altitude, the query aliases `last(\"sataltitude_km\")` as `alt_km`.\n\nIf the table returns tag columns with different names, open the query **Transform** tab and adjust, or set Geomap **Layer → Markers → Location** to the actual latitude/longitude field names (often `latitude` and `longitude`).\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Notes",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": [ "n2yo", "influx1", "starlink" ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": { "text": "Satellite Tracking", "value": "Satellite Tracking" },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "options": [],
        "query": "influxdb",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "Satellite Tracking",
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Starlink Geomap (InfluxQL v1, 100 sats)",
  "uid": "n2yo-starlink-influxql",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
